    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477951\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Mediator</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477952\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-advocate?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Advocate</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/jesus-christ-messenger-of-the-covenant?lang=eng\">Jesus Christ, Messenger of the Covenant</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477953\" id=\"p1\">no man cometh unto the Father, but <span class=\"key-word\">by me</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/14?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">John 14:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477954\" id=\"p2\">one <span class=\"key-word\">mediator</span> between God and men, the man Christ Jesus, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-tim/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">1 Tim. 2:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477956\" id=\"p3\">he is the <span class=\"key-word\">mediator</span> of a better covenant, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Heb. 8:6</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477957\" id=\"p4\">the <span class=\"key-word\">mediator</span> of the new testament, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Heb. 9:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477958\" id=\"p5\">Jesus the <span class=\"key-word\">mediator</span> of the new covenant, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Heb. 12:24</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/107?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">D&amp;C 107:19</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477959\" id=\"p6\">ye should look to the great <span class=\"key-word\">Mediator</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p28#p28\">2 Ne. 2:28</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477960\" id=\"p7\">made perfect through Jesus the <span class=\"key-word\">mediator</span> of the new covenant, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/76?lang=eng&amp;id=p69#p69\">D&amp;C 76:69</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477961\" id=\"title3\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/gal/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Gal. 3:19</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
